Description: Use the classic Sphinx "threads" worker model.
 Classic Sphinx 2.2.x (Debian's sphinxsearch, the grommunio search backend) does not
 know the Manticore/Sphinx-3 "thread_pool" value that piler 1.4.9 ships in its
 searchd template and aborts with "FATAL: unknown workers=thread_pool value".
Author: grommunio <dev@grommunio.com>
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-24

--- a/etc/sphinx.conf.in	2026-09-24 22:30:20.250182416 +0200
+++ b/etc/sphinx.conf.in	2026-09-24 22:30:20.254180416 +0200
@@ -279,5 +279,5 @@
         preopen_indexes         = 1
         unlink_old              = 1
         thread_stack            = 512k
-        workers                 = thread_pool
+        workers                 = threads
 }
